{{!
    @template mod_quizgame/grading_info

    Tells the player how their game score becomes a grade, and their best score so far.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * targetinfo - Sentence about the score needed for the full grade (plain text).
    * hasbestscore - Whether the player has a recorded score.
    * bestscoreinfo - Sentence with the player's best score (plain text).

    Example context (json):
    {
        "targetinfo": "Reach a game score of 10000 to earn the full grade of 100. Lower scores earn a proportional grade.",
        "hasbestscore": true,
        "bestscoreinfo": "Your best score so far: 7500"
    }
}}
<div class="mod_quizgame-gradinginfo alert alert-info" data-region="mod_quizgame-gradinginfo">
    <p class="mb-0">{{targetinfo}}</p>
    {{#hasbestscore}}
        <p class="mb-0 mt-2">{{bestscoreinfo}}</p>
    {{/hasbestscore}}
</div>
